Z||000000||artherd||11-30-2001||03:39 AM||||Well, I finally shoped around a bit and found a good price on THESE puppies! <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/porsche-s.jpg"> <P>(calipers and outter rotors only, the hats and adapter brackets still need to be machined)<P>Everyone around me thinks I'm insane for putting more money into wheels/tyres/brakes than I bought the *entire* Formula for...<P>But what do they know, right?<P>I'm not crazy for doing this, right? Right?!<P>TELL ME I AM NOT CRAZY!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>PS: now I'm definately broke! :S)<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
